            icon: "arcforge:tree_cutter",
            description: [
                "Steel Plates, an iron axe, saplings, a Block Breaker and Wrought Alloy. It plants and fells a 5×5 tree farm for 200 FE a log; Range Upgrades (glass panes, spyglasses, redstone, Steel Plate) add a block each side per card.",
                "",
                "**Covers:** {item:arcforge:tree_cutter}, {item:arcforge:range_upgrade}"
